# #1284 (see the repo-root .dockerignore for the full writeup — THAT file,
# not this one, is what `docker build` actually reads for this app, since
# `requireBuildContext` widens the context to the monorepo root. Kept here
# too, bare, for the hypothetical case this app is ever built with its own
# directory as context): `.vinext/fonts/<hash>/style.css` caches a self-hosted
# Google Font by an ABSOLUTE FILESYSTEM PATH computed at fetch time, and a
# stale, HOST-path-tainted copy silently defeats vinext's URL rewrite if it
# rides a Docker build's context into the image.
.vinext

# Same staleness class as `.vinext` above: `.output` is the HOST build's
# output tree the in-image `vite build` fully regenerates.
.output
